      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The petitioners are directed to surrender before the court below within two weeks from the date of receipt of the copy of this order and the learned court below on their surrender shall dispose of them bail application on the same day, strictly complying with the direction issued by this Court in the case of Birendra Jha @ Virendra Jha Vs. State of Jharkhand reported in 2001 (2) JLJR 76 and also in the light of the direction issued by the Hon'ble Apex Court in Satender Kumar Antil Vs. Central Bureau of Investigation & Anr., reported in 2021 (10) SCC 773.",
